  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Coordinator of the WBG Gender and Climate Program, to deepen integration of the gender climate nexus in WBG climate strategy, operations, knowledge, learning, and reporting, as spearheaded by the Climate Group, and mainstreamed throughout the institution</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samordnare f&#xf6;r WBG:s genus- och klimatprogram, f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rdjupa integrationen av k&#xf6;nsklimatet i WBG:s klimatstrategi, verksamhet, kunskap, l&#xe4;rande och rapportering, 
med klimatgruppen i spetsen och integreras i hela institutionen.</narrative>
  </description>
